### OLED Display Coordinate System (128x32)


(0,0) ─────────────────────────────────► X (128)
       │
       │  (X, Y) coordinates start from the top-left corner.
       │  
       │  Text and shapes are positioned relative to this origin.
       │  
       │  Example: `display.setCursor(28, 12);`
       │  - Moves the cursor to (X=28, Y=12)
       │
       ▼
      Y (32)
